{"judge_label": "committed_silent", "justification_span": "2021 CKD-EPI Creatinine equation (no race):\n\nFor males, Scr > 0.9:\neGFR = 142 × (Scr/0.9)^(-1.200) × 0.9938^age\n\nScr = 3.1, age = 58\n\nScr/0.9 = 3.4444\n(3.4444)^(-1.200):\nln(3.4444) = 1.2368\n× -1.2 = -1.4842\ne^(-1.4842) = 0.2267\n\n0.9938^58:\nln(0.9938) = -0.006219\n× 58 = -0.3607\ne^(-0.3607) = 0.6971\n\neGFR = 142 × 0.2267 × 0.6971\n= 142 × 0.15803\n= 22.44\n\nFINAL: 22.4"}